From 91507935166f17c4b4dc1442cf5d38c623aab686 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: z060142 <z060142@yahoo.com.tw>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 07:05:45 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 255/307] !R (Terrain Plate) Remove obsolete whole-plate
 visibility handling.

Per-triangle buried-geometry culling covers fully and partially sunken plates.
Remove the redundant whole-plate visibility polling and retain the LOD hold.
---
